# Privacy (GDPR)

Source of truth: AGENTS.md section 8 and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md section 6. For any change touching health data, consent, export, deletion or other users' data, follow the `campus-motion-privacy` skill in .agents/skills/.

1. Weight, height and birth date are collected or sent only after explicit opt-in (`consent_given_at`). Withdrawing consent deletes the data.
2. Health metrics travel inside `sensitive_data` with `client_key_version`.
3. New activities and other user-generated content default to private (`is_public: false`).
4. Never remove or bypass `UserService.deleteHealth()` or `UserService.deleteMe()`.
5. The JSON export in Settings includes any new personal data.
6. Health records keep `retain_until`.
7. No data leaves the device except to the Campus Motion API. No Firebase, analytics or tracking SDKs.
8. Never commit `.env` files, `google-services.json`, tokens or credentials.
